  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d0e06f179b05a9346a618d4dc0a79844, type: 3}
  m_Name: SecondTutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FoolsBrand.UI.TutorialSequence
  <Tutorials>k__BackingField:
  - <AdvanceCondition>k__BackingField: 3
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: You might have noticed that you can reserve a
      die. This stores one for later if you don't need it now and you can swap which
      die you have reserved at any time. Try reserving one now by interacting with
      one of your die. If you want your dice back just reserve another die.
  - <AdvanceCondition>k__BackingField: 1
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Most enemies have more than one part you can choose
      to attack. Deciding which part to go for is crucial if you want to live until
      the end. Pick which limb you want to attack, I'd suggest the eye.
  - <AdvanceCondition>k__BackingField: 1
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Interesting choice, hope it was a good one. Good
      luck on killing this one!
